gun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\">소장할 수 있는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;font-family:Malgun;mso-ascii-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#202124;\">15,000</span><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\">포인트</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;font-family:Malgun;mso-ascii-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#202124;\">1+2</span><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\">를 할 수 있는 쿠폰 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;mso-hansi-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#202124;\">■ </span><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\">신청 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;font-family:Malgun;mso-ascii-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#202124;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\">재학 중인 학부생 및 대학원생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;font-family:Malgun;mso-ascii-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#202124;\">300</span><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;color:#202124;\">명</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;font-family:Malgun;mso-ascii-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#202124;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:Malgun;mso-fareast-font-family:Malgun;mso-hansi-font-family:Malgun;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color